The Young Black Stallion is a 2003 American drama
film produced by Walt Disney Pictures.

12
00:29:24,000 --> 00:29:30,000
Directed by Simon Wincer, the film is based on the 1989 novel of the same name by
Black Stallion creator Walter Farley and his son Steven Farley.

13
00:31:51,000 --> 00:31:57,000
Noted for its beautiful scenery and wide-angle shots, the 50-minute film was
shot on-location in the deserts of Namibia and South Africa.

14
00:34:18,000 --> 00:34:24,000
The film stars Biana G.

