Tamimi as Neera, a young girl who befriends a young black stallion, and Patrick Elyas as Aden, although his voice was dubbed by Eric Grucza,
who, for his uncredited performance, was nominated in 2004 for a Young Artist Award for Best Performance in a Voice-Over Role.

16
00:39:12,000 --> 00:39:18,000
The film is Disney’s first production made specifically for IMAX theaters, and a prequel to
United Artists/Ford Coppola's award winning 1979 film The Black Stallion.

17
00:41:39,000 --> 00:41:45,000
Originally scheduled for fall 2002, it was postponed until September 2003, before
debuting in select IMAX theaters in the United States on December 25, 2003.

18
